                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does milestone gifting drive for gift-focused D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>10-25% of annual revenue for jewelry + personalised gifts + luxury + experience categories. Year-round distributed.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I focus on peak or evergreen milestone marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Both. 60-70% evergreen + 30-40% peak occasion. Sustained year-round investment + peak occasion amplification.</p>
                                        <h3>Is personalisation worth the ops complexity?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — 25-45% AOV lift + higher emotional value + repeat purchase. Ops discipline required for consistent quality.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I offer reminder services?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — customer-saved dates + reminder infrastructure drives repeat + LTV. Simple email / SMS reminder programs work.</p>
